WEBVTT

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:10.940
Where is the resistance hideout?

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.910
What new evil plot are you up to?

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.890
Tell me, please.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:19.950
The Divine Emperor...

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.740
The Divine Emperor?

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:25.540
We're going to shove your head up his ass.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:32.110
What an amusing plan!

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:44.440
I won't kill you yet.

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:47.240
Patch her up.

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:48.300
Yes, sir!

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:07.920
Wake up!

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:25.270
Please, let me go home!

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:26.770
Shut up.

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:28.730
I have a daughter!

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:31.290
A daughter?

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:34.070
She needs me!

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:35.280
Get back to work!

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:36.740
I didn't do anything!

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:38.780
Send me home!

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:45.900
This isn't a show. Get back to work--

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:47.540
Hey!

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:50.920
Oh no!

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:53.130
You, too?

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:54.510
I need to stop him!

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:55.260
Wait!

00:01:57.680 --> 00:01:59.010
Hey!

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:05.860
Don't!

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:54.000
"Episode 22: Escape from the Quarry"

00:03:56.380 --> 00:04:00.150
You should worry about yourself,
not the other prisoners.

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.160
You never learn, huh?

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:07.290
It's a virtue, if you ask me.

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:10.440
Sorry it's taking so long.

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:14.040
Kartz, Deo, and I are working
on an escape plan.

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:17.880
There's still time before I die.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:22.020
As long as you don't die, there is hope.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:25.530
And as long as there is hope,
there is possibility.

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:29.860
And as long as there is possibility,
you must continue to live.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:33.710
I like that.

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:36.780
Someone very important to me gave it to me.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.500
I'll remember it, too.

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.220
Hey, eat up.

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:46.690
You need your strength.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:50.850
He said he had a daughter, right?

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:51.720
Yeah.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:55.430
I have a family on the outside, too.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.380
We all do.

00:04:58.810 --> 00:04:59.650
Yeah.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:05.390
The escape plan has two parts.

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:09.620
First, we cause confusion here in the quarry.

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:13.950
Second, we take advantage
of the chaos to save our leader.

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:15.410
When do we do it?

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:18.150
The day they carry out the coffin.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.570
Bazuku-<i>sama</i>!

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:36.690
Ugly!

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:40.170
Incomplete, unfinished, trash!

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.140
Start over!

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:45.930
The ritual is almost upon us.

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:49.000
Make damn sure it's ready!

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:54.870
Why are we doing it on
the day they carry out the coffin?

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:58.540
We can't get away as long
as the Tower of Garzel is there.

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:02.160
They're going to temporarily
shut it down on that day.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:05.650
The guards don't want
to die any more than we do.

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.080
So we hit them when it's off.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:12.920
Will both the Tower of Garzel
and the backup really shut down?

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:16.390
I'm afraid we don't know.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:20.690
This is the first time we've
seen them carry the coffin away.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:26.150
If they leave the second
tower up to prevent escapees...

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:28.360
We'll need to shut it down, too.

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:33.480
It's the perfect accessory
for a beautiful girl like you.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:38.130
I won't need to wear a disguise
in the imperial city anymore.

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:44.090
If you weren't an enemy, 
I'd want to hire you.

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.760
I'd refuse.

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:51.700
Let's see how long
you can keep that mouth of yours.

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:04.690
Actually, I once destroyed 
the Tower of Garzel.

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:05.900
That's ridiculous.

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:06.650
How?

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:11.750
If you stab the tower
with a sword when it's active,

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:16.860
it acts as a lightning rod,
destroying the tower with its own lightning.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:21.750
Come on... You're kidding.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:23.810
I did it.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:25.670
That's all I can tell you.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:32.510
Then the plan itself
doesn't really change, but...

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:35.400
We'll have to destroy the backup tower.

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:39.560
We can't do all this with three people.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:42.520
Hey.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:46.140
Would you let us help?

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:49.320
We'll do anything to get out of here...

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:51.280
For our families on the outside.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:55.120
Um...

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:58.260
Takuya, what do we do?

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:05.270
If the plan fails,
we'll meet a fate worse than torture.

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:08.210
If you're not okay with that, then leave now.

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:13.120
Even if this works, some of you will die.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:16.300
If you can't handle that, then leave now.

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:26.640
Okay, from now on, you're one of us.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:30.580
Welcome to the resistance!

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:40.120
Has anything changed among the prisoners?

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:45.330
Takuya, prisoner number 1098,
is friendly with Amanda, supposedly.

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:50.000
He may be part of the resistance.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.300
Impossible.

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:58.510
1098 was imprisoned for the crime
of raping the priestess at the border,

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:00.300
the boundary of the world.

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:04.590
There must be some other 
rat inside my prison.

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:06.830
But...

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:10.130
He does seem good at seducing women.

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:13.290
He may be useful.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:27.540
1098 is here!

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:30.280
Behave yourself!

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:34.120
Welcome!

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:37.770
This is a fancy room
for the middle of the desert.

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:41.850
I have something to show you.

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:45.170
This tapestry...

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:47.140
Well?

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:49.190
Perfect, isn't it?

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:50.730
Yeah.

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:53.340
Looking at it's enough to make
you lose your mortal appetites.

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:57.400
You understand art, it seems.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:02.390
Did you bring me here to show me this?

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.410
I'm offering you a deal.

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.880
I hear you're quite close to Amanda.

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:12.090
I want you to get her to talk.

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:14.750
And if I do?

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:18.010
I'll let you see your daughter.

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:20.590
Yu-No, was that her name?

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:24.850
You'll let me decide how it's done, right?

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:28.980
Of course. Make her yours, if you like.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:32.740
Okay. Can you lend me that sword, then?

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:34.800
That?

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:37.120
It belongs to the knight Ailia.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:41.310
Amanda's sister. Her only relative.

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:43.570
It should come in handy.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:47.460
Very well. You may have it.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:10.110
Very well.

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:16.360
The priestess's coffin is complete!

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:18.570
Yes! We're done!

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:20.710
It's tonight, right?

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:28.130
I want to talk to Amanda tonight.

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:29.580
Tonight?

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:30.750
Do it some other time.

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:32.830
It needs to be tonight.

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:34.310
Check with Bazuku.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:37.340
It's just fine.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.130
Let him do as he wishes.

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:42.550
But tonight, the priestess's coffin...

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:44.210
It's overdone.

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:46.060
Have them remake it.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:08.490
Go!

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:09.080
Yes, sir!

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:14.250
Okay.

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:16.010
Let's start the fun.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:20.950
Thanks.

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:29.130
Don't blame me for this.

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:38.500
What's that voice?

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:49.110
You're going to regret this--

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.370
You saved me!

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:54.670
You owe me now.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:57.790
Hey, stay together!

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:01.550
Follow the plan! Head 
for the Tower of Garzel!

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:05.900
All the prisoners are rioting!

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:09.610
Shoot them down with the lightning!

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:11.560
We can't...

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:15.020
They're using the guards as hostages!

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:16.770
We can't hurt them!

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.730
I don't care.

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:20.820
Do it.

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:21.690
But...

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:25.650
You're being paid well for the danger.

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:28.910
If I ask you to die, you will!

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:30.370
But...

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:32.640
If you can't, I will!

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.170
Can you stand, Amanda?

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:41.690
Yeah.

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:53.310
Boss, I got it!

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:54.870
Bazuku headed for the tower!

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:56.390
Be careful!

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:57.590
Got it!

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:21.920
This is the judgment of god!

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:31.390
The tower!

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:32.720
Run!

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:36.380
The Tower of Garzel!

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:38.230
We're heading back!

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:38.980
Right!

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.190
Accept your judgment!

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:48.900
This is not good!

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.240
We need to stop Bazuku first!

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:58.370
Damn it! The backup tower's active too!

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.170
Can you throw the sword?

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:02.330
I need to get closer!

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:10.510
Amanda!

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:12.260
Don't move.

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:14.860
Why don't you put down that sword?

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:18.730
Oh, don't get any ideas.

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:23.240
You won't sleep well if
she dies because of you, you know.

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:30.990
Let her go.

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:32.620
Not yet.

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:36.660
Kill all the prisoners.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:40.330
You control the tower.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.550
The lightning stopped!

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.800
Men! Go! Go!

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:51.510
Open a path for Kartz!

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:53.020
Now!

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:06.680
We did it...

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:09.150
Boss was right!

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:18.610
O-Oh no...

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:23.040
You bastards!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.960
You're a lucky man.

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:33.260
I'll punish you myself!

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:54.200
Y-You!

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:22.900
He's a lucky man.

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:24.680
The tower!

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:27.900
Oww...

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.730
I broke something...

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.690
I'm in here! Somebody!

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:38.370
Somebody, save me! I'm in here!

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:41.570
Save me! Save me!

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:44.500
It's no good.

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:46.330
We have to jump!

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:47.330
That's impossible.

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:48.710
Break even so much as a leg

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.550
and you'll die in the desert
before you reach the imperial city.

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:53.890
Do you want to get fried here, then?

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:58.510
I don't want to dry up or get fried.

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:01.390
I'll choose death on my own terms.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:04.220
As long as you don't die, there is hope.

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:07.160
And as long as there is hope,
there is possibility.

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:12.030
And as long as there is possibility,
you must continue to live, huh?

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:35.060
Takuya! Takuya!

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:37.510
What? Who's that?

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:43.420
Takuya!

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:47.350
Is that Kunkun?

00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:50.680
Jump!

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:51.800
Let's go!

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:02.260
You saved us, Kunkun!

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:22.140
I can't believe you made a nogard into a pet.

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:26.150
Kunkun, you've got such big boobs now...

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:30.040
You haven't changed, huh?

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:39.770
Is that the imperial city?

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:41.760
It's huge.

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:43.820
It's big, but empty at its core.

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:47.620
Kunkun?

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:57.550
Oww...

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:01.800
Kunkun?

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:09.860
I'm sorry... I pushed you too hard...

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:12.950
Thank you...

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:17.320
For saving me twice...

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:19.330
I'm the one who should thank you!

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:26.120
I love you and Yu-No...

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:29.650
Yeah. The three of us can
all play together again someday.

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:31.700
I promise.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:39.540
I want to... be one with you...

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:42.510
I want to be...

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:45.890
With you...

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:50.090
Kunkun...

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:52.900
Takuya.

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:57.150
What?

00:20:57.650 --> 00:20:59.460
Nogards are food.

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:02.250
You know what that means, right?

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:08.950
You can't be serious!

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:10.700
She won't survive long.

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:13.210
Do your duty as her owner.

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:16.020
--What are you--
--The imperial city is still far away.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:21.580
Do you want to die here,
and let her death be for nothing?

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:25.050
But...

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:29.490
It's her last wish.

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:34.220
Grant it.

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:48.450
Takuya...

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:58.290
I love you...

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:41.530
"Episode 23: The Imperial City,
Where the Wind Blows"

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:41.530
Episode 23: "The Imperial City,
Where the Wind Blows."
